    A('直接引语与间接引语的边界在“是否声称保留原话”：直接引语要求措辞和标点准确，间接引语可以保留意义与交际功能而不逐字复制。','The boundary is whether exact wording is claimed: direct quotation requires accurate wording and punctuation, while reported speech may preserve meaning and communicative function without copying every word.',[['Leo','subject'],['refused','predicate'],['to leave.','clause','不定式作 refused 的补足语','Infinitival complement of refused']],Q('Leo said, "No, I won’t leave." 按交际功能可转述为？','How can Leo’s words be reported by communicative function?','Leo refused to leave.','Leo refused to leave.','Leo asked whether he left.','Leo asked whether he left.','A','refused to leave 保留“拒绝离开”的功能，不冒充逐字原话。','refused to leave preserves the refusal without claiming exact wording.'),'间接引语可以用 refused 概括 No, I won’t... 的拒绝功能；若加引号，就必须忠实保留原话。','Reported speech may summarize the refusal with refused; quotation marks would instead claim the exact words.'),
    A('转换前先判断原话的交际类型；陈述、疑问、命令、请求、建议和感叹会选择不同的报告动词与结构。','Before transforming, identify the communicative type; statements, questions, commands, requests, suggestions and exclamations require different reporting verbs and frames.',[['The teacher','subject'],['asked','predicate'],['us','object'],['to wait.','objectComplement','不定式作宾语补足语','Infinitival object complement']],Q('"Please wait." 表请求时应先选择哪种骨架？','Which frame should be chosen first for the request “Please wait”?','ask + 人 + to do','ask + person + to do','say + that 从句','say + that-clause','A','please wait 的功能是请求，不按表面祈使形式机械套 that。','Please wait functions as a request, so it does not mechanically take a that-clause.'),'asked us to wait 同时交代请求者、请求对象和行动；这一步先于时态、人称等细节调整。','asked us to wait identifies requester, addressee and action; choosing this frame comes before smaller tense or person adjustments.')
